# ==================== BOOKING.HTML TRANSLATIONS ====================
msgid "Online Booking - Days Safaris"
msgstr "Uhifadhi wa Mtandaoni - Days Safaris"

msgid ""
"Book your Kenya or East Africa safari online with Day Safaris Adventures. "
"Choose a destination, date and group size and we confirm within 24 hours."
msgstr ""
"Hifadhi safari yako ya Kenya au Afrika Mashariki mtandaoni na Day Safaris "
"Adventures. Chagua eneo, tarehe na idadi ya kundi na tunathibitisha ndani ya"
" saa 24."

msgid "Online Booking"
msgstr "Uhifadhi wa Mtandaoni"

msgid "Home"
msgstr "Nyumbani"

msgid "Booking"
msgstr "Kuweka Nafasi"

msgid "Book Your Safari Adventure"
msgstr "Weka Nafasi ya Safari Yako"

msgid ""
"Ready to experience the adventure of a lifetime? Booking your safari with "
"Day Safaris is quick and easy. Our team of travel experts will help you "
"customize your perfect African getaway, whether you're dreaming of "
"witnessing the Great Migration, relaxing on tropical beaches, or climbing "
"majestic mountains."
msgstr ""
"Uko tayari kupata matukio ya maisha? Kuweka nafasi ya safari yako na Day "
"Safaris ni haraka na rahisi. Timu yetu ya wataalam wa usafiri itakusaidia "
"kubinafsisha likizo yako bora ya Kiafrika, iwe unaota kushuhudia Uhamaji "
"Mkubwa, kupumzika kwenye fukwe za kitropiki, au kupanda milima mikuu."

msgid ""
"Take advantage of our early bird discounts and group booking offers. All our"
" packages include professional guides, comfortable accommodations, park "
"entry fees, and 24/7 support throughout your journey. Book today and pay "
"later with our flexible payment plans!"
msgstr ""
"Nufaika na punguzo letu la mapema na ofa za kuweka nafasi za kikundi. "
"Vifurushi vyetu vyote vinajumuisha waongozi wataalamu, malazi starehe, ada "
"za kuingia kwenye mbuga, na msaada wa saa 24/7 katika safari yako yote. Weka"
" nafasi leo na ulipe baadaye kwa mipango yetu rahisi ya malipo!"

msgid "Book A Tour"
msgstr "Hifadhi Safari"

msgid ""
"On Your First Adventure Trip With Day Safaris Adventures. Get More Deal With"
" Us Today."
msgstr ""
"Katika safari yako ya kwanza ya matukio na Day Safaris Adventures. Pata ofa "
"zaidi nasi leo."

