"Choose the perfect season for your adventure based on wildlife viewing, "
"weather, and crowds."
msgstr ""
"Chagua msimu mzuri kwa matukio yako kulingana na kutazama wanyamapori, hali "
"ya hewa na wingi wa watu."

msgid "Peak Season"
msgstr "Msimu wa kilele"

msgid "July - October:"
msgstr "Julai - Oktoba:"

msgid ""
"Best for wildlife viewing, dry weather, and optimal safari conditions. "
"Expect more visitors but incredible sightings."
msgstr ""
"Bora kwa kutazama wanyamapori, hali ya hewa kavu na mazingira bora ya "
"safari. Tarajia wageni wengi lakini maonyesho ya kustaajabisha."

msgid "Green Season"
msgstr "Msimu wa kijani"

msgid "November - December & March - May:"
msgstr "Novemba - Desemba na Machi - Mei:"

msgid ""
"Lush landscapes, fewer crowds, lower prices, and excellent bird watching "
