msgid ""
"Spot diverse wildlife including the Big Five and unique species native to "
"this region."
msgstr ""
"Ona wanyamapori mbalimbali wakiwemo Big Five na spishi za kipekee za eneo "
"hili."

msgid "Rich Culture"
msgstr "Utamaduni tajiri"

msgid ""
"Immerse yourself in local traditions and authentic cultural experiences."
msgstr "Jitumbukize katika mila za wenyeji na uzoefu halisi wa kitamaduni."

msgid "Photo Opportunities"
msgstr "Fursa za kupiga picha"

