# ==================== AFRICAN WILDLIFE TOURS.HTML TRANSLATIONS
# ====================
msgid "African Wildlife Tours - Days Safaris Adventures"
msgstr "Safari za Wanyamapori Afrika - Days Safaris Adventures"

msgid ""
"African wildlife tours: Big Five game drives, the Great Migration and "
"gorilla trekking, organised by Day Safaris Adventures."
msgstr ""
"Ziara za wanyamapori wa Afrika: safari za Big Five, Uhamaji Mkuu na kutembea"
" kuwaona sokwe, zinazoandaliwa na Day Safaris Adventures."

msgid "African Wildlife Tours"
msgstr "Safari za Wanyamapori Afrika"

msgid "Explore African Wildlife Tours"
msgstr "Gundua Safari za Wanyamapori Afrika"

msgid ""
"Day Safaris Adventures offers a wide range of African Wildlife Safari "
"packages, Kenya, one of them being the country where the word 'Safari' "
"(Swahili for 'journey') actually comes from. Close encounters with a variety"
" of wildlife in breath-taking landscapes, luxurious and unusual camps and "
"lodges and the fascinating culture of Kenyan tribes bring the country top of"
" many lists for the best wildlife safaris in Africa."
msgstr ""
"Day Safaris Adventures inatoa aina mbalimbali za vifurushi vya Safari za "
"Wanyamapori Afrika, Kenya, ikiwa ni moja ya nchi ambapo neno 'Safari' "
"(Kiswahili kwa 'safari') linatokana. Kukutana kwa karibu na aina mbalimbali "
"za wanyamapori katika mandhari ya kupendeza, kambi na lodji za kifahari na "
"zisizo za kawaida na utamaduni wa kuvutia wa makabila ya Kenya huifanya nchi"
" hii kuwa ya juu katika orodha nyingi za safari bora za wanyamapori barani "
"Afrika."

msgid ""
"A hunting ban over the last 35 years has also reduced animals' fear of "
"humans making Kenya more approachable, allowing the best wildlife safaris in"
" Kenya to be really close to wildlife."
msgstr ""
"Marufuku ya uwindaji kwa miaka 35 iliyopita pia imepunguza hofu ya wanyama "
"kwa wanadamu na kufanya Kenya kukaribika zaidi, na kuruhusu safari bora za "
"wanyamapori nchini Kenya kuwa karibu sana na wanyamapori."

msgid ""
"The various habitats, from grasslands, to riverine forests, to moorlands and"
" semi-deserts, accounts for the variety of wildlife in Kenya. This also "
"means that there is a huge range of choice for your wildlife safari trip. We"
" won't deny that many of the best wildlife safari destinations in Kenya, "
"like Maasai Mara National Reserve or Samburu, are very popular and thus "
"busy. However, with our experience we can help you to avoid the crowds!"
msgstr ""
"Makazi mbalimbali, kutoka nyasi, hadi misitu ya mito, hadi nyika na nusu "
"jangwa, huchangia aina mbalimbali za wanyamapori nchini Kenya. Hii pia "
"inamaanisha kuwa kuna chaguo nyingi kwa safari yako ya wanyamapori. "
"Hatutakanusha kwamba maeneo mengi bora ya safari za wanyamapori nchini "
"Kenya, kama Hifadhi ya Taifa ya Maasai Mara au Samburu, ni maarufu sana na "
"hivyo kuwa na watu wengi. Hata hivyo, kwa uzoefu wetu tunaweza kukusaidia "
"kuepuka umati!"

msgid ""
"Others wildlife Safaris include those in Tanzania, a country that offers a "
"winning combination: some of Africa's best wildlife safaris plus stunning "
"tropical beaches. Besides the Serengeti's famous wildebeest migration, there"
" are other world-class safari locations here. There is also Volcanoes "
"National Park in Rwanda, and Addo Elephant Park and Samara Game Reserve in "
"South Africa among others."
msgstr ""
"Safari nyingine za wanyamapori zinajumuisha zile za Tanzania, nchi inayotoa "
"mchanganyiko mzuri: safari bora za wanyamapori barani Afrika pamoja na fukwe"
" za kupendeza za kitropiki. Kando na uhamaji maarufu wa nyumbu wa Serengeti,"
" kuna maeneo mengine ya safari ya kiwango cha kimataifa hapa. Pia kuna "
"Hifadhi ya Taifa ya Volcanoes nchini Rwanda, na Hifadhi ya Tembo ya Addo na "
"Hifadhi ya Wanyama ya Samara nchini Afrika Kusini miongoni mwa mengine."

# ==================== AIRPORT TRANSFERS.HTML TRANSLATIONS
# ====================
msgid "Airport Transfers - Days Safaris Adventures"
msgstr "Uhamisho wa Uwanja wa Ndege - Days Safaris Adventures"

msgid ""
"Reliable airport transfers in Nairobi (JKIA and Wilson) and across Kenya "
"with Day Safaris Adventures."
msgstr ""
"Usafiri wa kuaminika wa uwanja wa ndege jijini Nairobi (JKIA na Wilson) na "
"kote Kenya na Day Safaris Adventures."

msgid "Airport Transfers"
msgstr "Uhamisho wa Uwanja wa Ndege"

msgid "Explore Our Airport Transfers"
msgstr "Gundua Uhamisho Wetu wa Uwanja wa Ndege"

msgid ""
"What's the best way to get from the airport to your destination? Let Day "
"Safaris Adventures help solve this for you. We are one of Kenya's biggest "
"tour company providing the best services, even airport transfers services."
msgstr ""
"Ni njia gani bora ya kutoka uwanja wa ndege hadi unakoenda? Acha Day Safaris"
" Adventures ikusaidie kutatua hili kwako. Sisi ni moja ya kampuni kubwa za "
"utalii nchini Kenya inayotoa huduma bora, hata huduma za uhamisho wa uwanja "
"wa ndege."

msgid ""
"We are currently working in partnership with over 50 companies in Kenya and "
"outside the country. We can find the right car in the right place, at the "
"right price. Enter your dates and airport and we'll find all the options, "
"including private transfers, shared shuttles, minibuses or coaches. Compare "
"prices, find the deal that suits you best, then book your airport transfer "
"direct."
msgstr ""
"Kwa sasa tunafanya kazi kwa ushirikiano na zaidi ya kampuni 50 nchini Kenya "
"na nje ya nchi. Tunaweza kupata gari sahihi mahali pazuri, kwa bei inayofaa."
" Weka tarehe zako na uwanja wa ndege na tutapata chaguo zote, ikiwa ni "
"pamoja na uhamisho wa kibinafsi, shuttles za pamoja, minibasi au makochi. "
"Linganisha bei, pata ofa inayokufaa zaidi, kisha hifadhi uhamisho wako wa "
"uwanja wa ndege moja kwa moja."

msgid "NB:"
msgstr "KUMBUKA:"

msgid ""
"Don't wait until you get to your destination to find your airport transfer. "
"Enter your details on our contacts page and Day Safaris Adventures will help"
" you choose a reliable company and get a great deal from airports worldwide."
" Then you can relax knowing it's all taken care of."
msgstr ""
"Usisubiri hadi ufike unakoenda ili kupata uhamisho wako wa uwanja wa ndege. "
"Weka maelezo yako kwenye ukurasa wetu wa mawasiliano na Day Safaris "
"Adventures itakusaidia kuchagua kampuni ya kuaminika na kupata ofa nzuri "
"kutoka kwa viwanja vya ndege duniani kote. Kisha unaweza kupumzika ukijua "
"yote yameshughulikiwa."

# ==================== HOLIDAY TAILOR MADE TOURS.HTML TRANSLATIONS
# ====================
msgid "Holiday Tailor Made Tours - Days Safaris Adventures"
msgstr "Safari za Likizo Maalum - Days Safaris Adventures"

msgid ""
"Tailor-made holidays built around your dates, budget and interests by the "
"Day Safaris Adventures travel team."
msgstr ""
"Likizo zilizobuniwa kulingana na tarehe zako, bajeti na mapendeleo yako na "
