msgid "Explore Our Holiday Tailor Made Tours"
msgstr "Gundua Safari zetu za Likizo Maalum"

msgid ""
"Day Safaris Adventures is your authentic travel partner of integrity "
"focussed on providing unequal travel experiences on the African Continent. "
"We specialise in complete travel management with special focus on family "
"travel, wildlife safaris, special interest tours and romantic honeymoons."
