"safari za wanyamapori, safari za maslahi maalum na fungate za kimapenzi."

msgid ""
"All our holidays are tailor-made and we pride ourselves in matching your "
"holiday travel preparations arrangements to your exact needs and special "
"interests. Our vacations are all carefully designed so that your holiday "
"experience is one of a kind, leaving memories that are only yours to keep!"
msgstr ""
"Likizo zetu zote ni maalum na tunajivunia kulinganisha mipango yako ya "
"maandalizi ya usafiri wa likizo na mahitaji yako halisi na maslahi maalum. "
"Likizo zetu zote zimeundwa kwa uangalifu ili uzoefu wako wa likizo uwe wa "
"kipekee, ukiacha kumbukumbu ambazo ni zako tu kuzihifadhi!"

msgid "Excellent value for money"
msgstr "Thamani bora kwa pesa"

