"management for travel agents worldwide."
msgstr ""
"Shirikiana na Day Safaris Adventures: huduma za wageni na usimamizi wa "
"safari kwa mawakala wa usafiri duniani kote."

msgid "Explore Our Travel Partnerships"
msgstr "Gundua Ushirikiano Wetu wa Kusafiri"

msgid ""
"Day Safaris Adventures has partnered with award-winning tour operators to "
"bring you the best Travel Tours and flight plans across the globe. Whether "
"you are looking to explore Africa, Asia or the United States, temples, "
"embark on an off-the-beaten-track adventure or discover the wonders of the "
"world, we can help you plan your perfect trip."
msgstr ""
"Day Safaris Adventures imeshirikiana na waendeshaji watalii walioshinda tuzo"
" kukuletea Safari bora za Kusafiri na mipango ya ndege kote ulimwenguni. Iwe"
" unatafuta kuchunguza Afrika, Asia au Marekani, mahekalu, kuanza safari "
"isiyo ya kawaida au kugundua maajabu ya ulimwengu, tunaweza kukusaidia "
"kupanga safari yako bora."

msgid ""
"Enjoy the benefits of an African tour to West Africa, South Africa or Egypt "
"among other countries and explore multiple fascinating cultures and "
"countries in one go, whether you are looking to sight see in historic "
"cities, and enjoy various cuisines and dine on the finest food in the world."
" Admire wildlife on African safari with our Africa tours, or take a trip to "
"the United Arab Emirates and marvel at the modern architectural wonders of "
"cities like Dubai, Abu Dhabi and Sharjah, or the amazing sites like the Palm"
" Islands, Burj Khalifa and Sheikh Zayed."
msgstr ""
"Furahia manufaa ya safari ya Kiafrika hadi Afrika Magharibi, Afrika Kusini "
"au Misri miongoni mwa nchi nyingine na uchunguze tamaduni na nchi nyingi za "
"kuvutia kwa mkupuo mmoja, iwe unatafuta kutalii katika miji ya kihistoria, "
"na kufurahia vyakula mbalimbali na kula chakula bora zaidi duniani. Pendeza "
"wanyamapori kwenye safari za Kiafrika na safari zetu za Afrika, au fanya "
